                  <photoshop:LayerText>ArtCenter College of Design, Pasadena, CA BFA in Illustration, Entertainment Arts, August 2026 â€” With Honors GPA: 3.77 / 4.00   Gallery Selections  Digital Life | 2026 Digital Design | 2024   Scholarships &amp; Honors  Illustration Department Scholarship | 2026 Phil Hays Memorial Endowed Scholarship | 2026 Kenneth R. Deardoff Endowed Scholarship | 2025 Provostâ€™s List â€” 5 Semesters | 2024â€“2026 </photoshop:LayerText>
