               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>Software Photoshop, Blender, Maya, SketchUp, Procreate, Clip St</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Software Photoshop, Blender, Maya, SketchUp, Procreate, Clip Studio Paint, Illustrator, InDesign  Design Skills Environment Design, Visual Development, Worldbuilding, Game Prop Design, Color &amp; Lighting, Composition, 3D Blockout &amp; Paintover   Mandarin Chinese â€” Native English â€” Professional Working Proficiency</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName> Sandwich Truck Game Visual Development Artist | Environment Ar</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText> Sandwich Truck Game Visual Development Artist | Environment Artist Independent Game Project | Four-Person Team | Playable Demo | 2026 Software: Photoshop â€¢ Developed visual direction for a stylized cooking game featuring a fantasy sandwich truck and cat deity. â€¢ Designed environments, props, character assets, title screens, and key art for a playable demo. â€¢ Collaborated with a four-person team to establish the gameâ€™s visual style and asset direction.  Elven Village Environment Concept Artist Senior Grad Project | ArtCenter College of Design | 2026 Software: Photoshop, Blender â€¢ Designed a fantasy settlement focused on architecture, worldbuilding, lighting, and environmental storytelling. â€¢ Built Blender blockouts for perspective, scale, composition, and architectural development. â€¢ Created final environment paintings through a 3D-assisted Photoshop workflow.  Eva Annie Illustrator Personal Narrative Illustration Project | 2023â€“2025 Software: Photoshop â€¢ Created a narrative illustration series exploring the relationship between Eva and Annie. â€¢ Used color, lighting, composition, and atmosphere to support character-driven storytelling. </photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
